#. Translators: Dialog title for Image Analysis
#: addon\globalPlugins\visionAssistant\features\vision.py:865
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{name} - Image Analysis"
msgstr "{name} - Análisis de imagen"

#. Translators: Title of the error dialog shown when the selected OCR engine cannot process the chosen image-based files.
#: addon\globalPlugins\visionAssistant\features\vision.py:894
#: addon\globalPlugins\visionAssistant\features\vision.py:1287
