msgstr "Descargando soporte de audio del sistema, por favor espera..."

#. Translators: Success message after the system audio support download completes.
#: addon\globalPlugins\visionAssistant\utils\loopback.py:135
msgid "System audio support downloaded successfully!"
msgstr "¡Soporte de audio del sistema descargado correctamente!"

#. Translators: Error dialog shown when system audio loopback download fails. {error} is the error details.
#: addon\globalPlugins\visionAssistant\utils\loopback.py:142
